               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 66-year-old male patient, admitted on 29 December 2020 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. On admission, he presented with fever, dyspnoea, and reduced oxygen saturation. Chest X-ray and CT thorax confirmed bilateral COVID-19 pneumonia. Blood tests revealed elevated inflammatory markers and mild lymphopenia. Arterial blood gas analysis demonstrated hypoxaemic respiratory failure. The patient was treated with supplemental oxygen therapy, dexamethasone, and anticoagulation. Supportive intravenous fluid replacement and regular vital sign monitoring were conducted throughout the stay. Pulse oximetry was monitored continuously. He showed gradual clinical improvement and was mobilised with physiotherapy support. At discharge on 08 January 2021, his oxygen saturation was stable on room air. Please continue monitoring his respiratory recovery and ensure outpatient follow-up. Discharge medications and further recommendations are enclosed. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Treating Physician]</div>
               </text>
            </section>
